  updated="16 November 2026"
>
  <p>
    This page explains the cookies and similar technologies used on
    dazzlit.com, and how to change your choice. You can change your cookie
    choice at any time using the button below.
  </p>
  <p>
    <button type="button" data-cookie-settings class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-5 py-2.5 font-display text-sm font-bold text-navy hover:border-violet">
      Change my cookie choice
    </button>
  </p>

  <h2>What we use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Your cookie choice.</strong> When you accept or decline cookies, we store that choice in your browser so we do not ask you again on every visit.</li>
    <li><strong>Spam protection.</strong> Cloudflare Turnstile protects our proposal form from automated submissions. It may set cookies to tell real visitors from bots.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics 4.</strong> Only loaded if you accept cookies. It sets cookies that help us understand which pages are visited and how people use the site. We do not use it to identify you personally.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics.</strong> A privacy-friendly analytics service that does not use cookies.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do not use</h2>
  <p>We do not run advertising cookies or share cookie data with advertising networks through this site.</p>

  <h2>Changing your choice</h2>
  <p>You can accept or decline cookies using the banner at the bottom of the page, or the button above. You can also delete cookies through your browser settings at any time; declining cookies does not stop the site from working.</p>
</DocLayout>
